# Only consulted by `docker build`/buildx from this repo root — which today
# means CI building `sidecar/Dockerfile` (see .github/workflows). The local
# fallback build in `sidecar_image.rs` tars a scratch directory it wrote
# itself, so it never sees this file and doesn't need to.
.git
target
**/node_modules
# The Astro docs site. `ui/dist` is deliberately *not* ignored: the sidecar
# build needs it, because building the `fghj-sidecar` bin recompiles the whole
# lib crate, `web::ui`'s `include_dir!` included.
docs
